A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.2.6; 
son of: Zerah (H2226I); 
brother of: Zabdi (H2067), Heman (H1968H), Calcol (H3633H) and Dara (H1873); 
father of: Azariah (H5838I)
§ Ethan = "enduring"
